<p>You fire multiple arrows at an area of <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 2, 3, 3, 3</acronym> radius, doing <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">91%, 104%, 114%, 122%, 130%</acronym> damage with each arrow.</p>